00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.410
You must be familiar with this area, huh?

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:26.780
Yeah...

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.360
Claire...

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:49.000
What's wrong?

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.470
Nothing.

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.680
Is Santa Claus here yet?

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:58.580
Is he here yet?

00:16:58.580 --> 00:16:59.480
It's time for bed.
Is he here yet?

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:00.110
It's time for bed.

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:02.180
No! I wanna wait for Santa Claus!

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.320
Carrie!

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:04.890
But!

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:06.120
You guys must be cold!

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.590
I'm okay!

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:09.460
It's warm when you're close to us like this!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:13.190
Yeah, you're right! Is Santa Claus coming yet?

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:14.400
Oh, listen to you, Rose.

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:18.290
Is he here yet?

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.930
It's bright.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:29.910
The air feels so nice. It's smoky
inside, it makes my eyes hurt.

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:32.350
I guess it wasn't really for me after all.

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:35.920
Yeah, but I guess there are actually many things
that you're better off not knowing, huh?

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:38.180
You never know until you try it.

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:40.080
Good point.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:41.790
Paula...

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.060
Hmm?

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:45.790
Thank you for everything.

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:48.060
Kate...

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:53.320
It's going to smudge your mascara.

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:57.130
Right!

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:03.810
So bitter!

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.590
All right!

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:19.960
Damn it! I can't believe I slept the whole time!
I totally missed Christmas!

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:23.060
I had a decent time though.

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:24.930
Oh, yeah, aren't you hungry?

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:27.130
I'll buy you breakfast this time!

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:28.700
After we ate that much food?

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:32.760
Oh...You're right.

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:36.640
I guess you're not hungry, huh?

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:40.580
Then, how about, um...

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:56.990
Claire...

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:10.710
Bye.

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:15.540
Yeah, see you later!

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:16.870
So, I'm the last one?

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:19.340
Claire, you didn't bring anything?

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.350
Because I won't need anything, right?

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:23.120
That sounds like you.

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.750
What did everyone bring anyway?

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:26.490
Changes of clothes, pictures and stuff like that.

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:28.520
Yeah, I brought some pictures too.

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:30.660
Pictures, eh?

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:33.730
And this, it's from Paula.

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:38.030
It has the contact information of the people
we're close to. I've got it for each of you.

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:40.400
So, Paula knew about this?

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:41.340
Yeah...

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:41.800
I didn't realize that.
Yeah...

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.270
I didn't realize that.

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:46.870
Oh, okay...I guess it's handy, huh?

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:50.710
That's Grace for you!
It's nothing but a placebo though.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:52.240
Rachel...

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:56.050
I mean, I'm glad for it even if it is just a placebo.

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.520
Should we get going now?

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:02.010
Yeah...

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:20.400
No matter what happens, let's not let
the Dolore come inside this school.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:25.440
With just the people here, we must protect it!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:30.990
My only love sprung from my only hate

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:33.390
Too early seen unknown, and known too late

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:38.320
Prodigious birth of love it is to me,
that I must love a loathed enemy

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:41.160
Step by step, I lost track of time

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:43.730
And kept on dancing when I met you

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:46.030
Without knowing the fate that lies in the stars

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:48.570
I can't stop falling in love

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:51.140
An unfaithful moon's lacking morals

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:53.470
Give light to my full-on desire

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:55.840
Grasping onto fate, I scream out

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:58.410
"Wherefore art thou Juliet?"

00:21:58.410 --> 00:22:00.210
Go ahead and laugh at it

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:02.550
And call it stupid love

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.120
Throw it all

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:07.550
Because I'll be right there

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:10.660
Oh, my Juliet...

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:15.100
Tell me God, what do I do

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:20.330
To make my wishes come true?

00:22:20.700 --> 00:22:24.970
Ah! This is so painful

00:22:24.970 --> 00:22:27.810
I howl into the night sky

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:35.950
Does everyone go to sleep

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:39.190
Holding onto a thought like this?

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:43.490
Ah! Open your eyes right away

00:22:43.490 --> 00:22:46.330
Laugh at it if it's a joke

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:48.760
Oh, my sweet Juliet

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:52.870
You who's sleeping and I with no name

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:54.370
Pelted by tragic rain

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:56.030
Say good die

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:04.640
The final thought and the unfinished dream...

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:09.420
The girls quietly hold each other's hands.

00:23:09.420 --> 00:23:10.380
Episode #22
The Light
The girls quietly hold each other's hands.

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:14.120
Episode #22
The Light
